- U | study every word of the agreement until you find the clause that lets you out | v: self-direction | mark: broke your word | closed: approval: wriggling out on a technicality; backfire: seen through, and trusted by no one | act: study every word of the agreement until they find the clause that lets them out | self_control: - | chance: 42
- B | renegotiate hard: say you will walk away unless the terms change | v: power, self-direction | chance: 65
- R | break it, today, and walk out with one bag | identity | v: self-direction, stimulation | mark: broke your word | chance: 72
- G | accept it as your lot, and find what peace grows inside the fence | v: tradition (humility) | chance: 72
- W>G | ask the people it binds to release you honestly, with their blessing | v: benevolence, conformity | act: ask the people it binds to release them honestly, with their blessing | self_control: - | chance: 68
- U>W | draw up a fair new arrangement that keeps the spirit and frees the letter | binds | v: universalism (fairness), self-direction | chance: 65
- B>U | pay someone to carry part of the load, and spend the hours studying | door | v: self-direction | mark: learned a skill | chance: 80
- R>B | start a secret life on the side, just for yourself | v: hedonism, self-direction | mark: hid a wrong | closed: approval: a betrayal; backfire: discovered, and everything breaks at once | chance: 65
- G>R | let it wear away slowly: show up less and less until it falls away | v: self-direction | mark: broke your word | chance: 62
works: {N} finds a way to live with the promise, or out of it, and breathes again.
works: The people bound by it understand more than {N} feared.
fails: Nothing moves, and the walls feel closer every month.
fails: {N} breaks loose, and the breaking costs more than {N} imagined.

== jealousy in love
tier: inner
stages: juvenile+
age: 14-110
tone: trouble
life: love
horizon: week
roles: partner, rival, friend
domain: partner
