scene U: {N} notices the pattern before anything else: the late evenings, the new name that keeps coming up, the phone face down.
scene B: {N} has seen how {rival} looks at {partner}. {N} is not going to lose what is {Ns} without a fight.
scene R: The thought of {partner} with {rival} hits {N} like a fist, and for a moment {N} can hardly breathe.
scene G: Something has shifted between {N} and {partner}, the way the air shifts before weather. {N} feels it in {Ns} skin.
- W | tell them calmly how you feel, and ask them for the truth | v: benevolence, conformity | chance: 82
- U | watch quietly for a few weeks, and see whether the pattern holds | v: security, self-direction | chance: 68
- B | break it off first, before they get the chance to do it | v: security, self-direction | chance: 50
- R | confront them right now, voice raised, and demand to know | v: power, security | chance: 62
- G | trust the bond you have built, and let time show what is true | v: benevolence, security | chance: 75
- W>U | agree a time each week to talk it through honestly, and keep to it | v: benevolence, security | chance: 85
