- B>R | flirt with someone else where they can see, so they feel it too | v: power, hedonism | chance: 32
- R>G | hold them close tonight, and swear to fight the world for them | binds | v: benevolence | chance: 80
- G>W | ask old friends you both trust to help talk it through | v: tradition, conformity | chance: 65
works: The truth comes out, and it is gentler than {N} feared.
works: {N} and {partner} talk it through until the suspicion has nowhere left to live.
fails: The suspicion spreads into every evening, and {partner} grows tired of being watched.
fails: The fear turns out to be true, and {N} finds out the hard way.

== feeling invisible
tier: inner
stages: juvenile+
age: 12-110
tone: trouble
life: family, work, community
horizon: months
roles: sibling, colleague, child, a neighbour
earth: at the table, in the meeting, in the family chat, people talk over you and past you as if the chair were empty
requires: belonging below 0.35 for six weeks or more while ties stay above 0.3 (people are around, but nobody asks, answers or notices); or retirement within the year with ties falling
