- R | do something loud and daring right in the middle of everyone | body: light | v: stimulation, power (face) | chance: 68
- G | let your natural gift show without fuss, and wait for the right people to notice | v: achievement, tradition (humility) | chance: 60
- W>U | enter the contest that names the best, and prepare by its rules | v: achievement, conformity | chance: 45
- U>B | arrange things so the one in charge sees your best work first | v: power, achievement | chance: 72
- B>R | spend your savings on a look or a party everyone will talk about | v: hedonism, power (face) | chance: 78
- R>G | dress, sing or dance as yourself, loudly, whatever people think | identity | v: self-direction | chance: 78
- G>W | bring your best cake, carving or vegetables to the town show | v: achievement, tradition | mark: made a friend | chance: 78
works: Someone notices, and says so, and {N} carries the moment around for days.
works: {N} finds a way to be seen that feels like {N}.
fails: Nobody looks, or they look and then look away.
fails: The bid for attention goes wrong, and {N} is noticed for the wrong reason.

