rarer: a heartbreak within the last six months; close friends (belonging above 0.65); much White or Blue restraint where courting is frowned on
times: Many single people, a few times a year: a wedding, a couple close by, a song (estimate)
gap: 0-0.5
scene: At the next table a couple are laughing at nothing. {N} looks at the empty chair opposite and feels the quiet of it all the way down.
scene W: {N} has always pictured it: a home, a promise, someone to keep it with. The picture is still there, waiting for a face.
scene U: {N} wonders, not for the first time, what exactly is missing: the person, or the idea of the person.
scene B: Everyone else seems to find someone. {N} starts to think it is simply a matter of going out and getting what {N} wants.
scene R: The longing is like hunger. {N} wants to be held, to be wanted, to fall headlong, and soon.
scene G: Even the swans pair up in spring. {N} watches them on the river and trusts, nearly, that it will come.
- W | decide to wait for someone serious, and save yourself for a real commitment | v: conformity, tradition | chance: 55
- U | think hard about what you truly want in a partner, and write it down | v: self-direction | chance: 62
- B | dress your best and go where the most eligible people are | v: power (face), hedonism | chance: 72
- R | tell the one you like that you like them, straight away | v: stimulation, hedonism | mark: took a wild risk | chance: 50
- G | trust the right person will come in time, and live well meanwhile | v: security, tradition (humility) | chance: 65
- W>R | agree to a date a friend sets up, and go with an open heart | door | v: stimulation, hedonism | chance: 72
- U>G | track down the one you lost touch with years ago, the one who got away | v: benevolence, tradition | chance: 32
- B>W | use every contact you have to get introduced to someone serious | v: security, tradition | chance: 72
- R>U | go on a date a week with anyone who asks, to learn what you want | habit | door | v: stimulation, self-direction | chance: 85
- G>B | follow your instinct and go after the one you want, though they are taken | v: hedonism, self-direction | mark: made an enemy | closed: approval: courting someone already attached; backfire: a scandal, and a lasting feud | chance: 22
works: Someone appears, or reappears, and {N} feels the old quiet begin to lift.
works: {N} meets people, laughs more, and the longing loosens its grip.
fails: Each try ends in an awkward goodbye, and the empty chair gets louder.
fails: {N} reaches for the wrong person, and gets hurt.

== the urge to protect
tier: inner
stages: all
age: 12-110
tone: mixed
life: family, community
horizon: week
roles: child, sibling, parent, a neighbour
earth: someone you love is being pushed around, cheated or put at risk, and every part of you rises up
requires: within the week someone in the person's care (a child, a younger sibling, an old parent, a friend, a pet) threatened, mocked, cheated or put at risk, with ties to them above 0.5
likelier: parents, most of all of small children; much Green or White in the color history; reactivity above 1.2; the threat has a face and a name
rarer: stress above 2 (exhaustion); weak ties with the one at risk; the threat is far away and faceless
times: Most parents and carers, a few times a year (estimate)
gap: 0-0.5
scene: {N} sees it happen: someone in {Ns} care pushed aside, talked down to, put in danger. Something old and fierce wakes up in {N}.
scene W: {N} is responsible for them. That is not a feeling, it is a fact, and {N} intends to act on it.
scene U: {N} goes very calm and very clear, and starts working out exactly where the danger comes from and how to cut it off.
scene B: Nobody touches what is {Ns}. {N} files away the face of the one who did it, and starts thinking about leverage.
scene R: The heat goes straight up {Ns} spine. {N} is moving before {N} has decided anything.
scene G: {N} feels it the way an animal does, in the shoulders and the teeth: this one is mine, and I will stand over them.
- W | report it to whoever is responsible, and see that the rules are enforced | v: security, conformity | chance: 70
- U | work out where the danger comes from, and quietly put a safeguard in place | v: security | chance: 78
- B | find the leverage on the one responsible, and make them back off for good | v: power, security | mark: made an enemy | chance: 73
- R | step straight in between them and the danger, there and then | body: light | v: benevolence | mark: helped someone in need | chance: 80
- G | keep them close, and keep every stranger away from the door | v: security, benevolence | closed: approval: shutting people out; backfire: suspicion, and a lonely household | chance: 72
- W>G | rally the neighbours or classmates to face down the troublemaker together | identity | v: security, benevolence | mark: made an enemy | closed: approval: ganging up on someone; backfire: a feud, with the law or the school on the wrong side | chance: 70
- U>W | teach them the rules of staying safe until they know them by heart | habit | v: security, conformity | chance: 78
- B>U | call in a favour to get them taught to stand up for themselves | v: security, achievement | chance: 72
- R>B | lose your temper and threaten the one responsible to their face | v: power | closed: law: threats; backfire: the police, or a complaint against the one who threatened | chance: 48
- G>R | let them fight their own battle, and stand right behind them while they do | identity | v: self-direction, benevolence | chance: 70
works: The danger passes, and the one {N} protects is safe.
works: {N} stands firm, and the threat backs off for good.
fails: {N} overdoes it, and the one being protected is embarrassed by the fuss.
fails: The threat is bigger than {N} thought, and {N} cannot stop it alone.

== needing to be alone
tier: inner
stages: all
age: 12-110
tone: mixed
life: home, family
horizon: week
roles: partner, child, sibling, parent
earth: people in every room, voices on every side, and a growing need for one hour with nobody in it
requires: time below 0.15 (no hour of one's own) for four weeks or more with people pressing on every side (children or caring held, a shared room, a full house), and stress above 1
likelier: small children at home; a caring role; a shared room in the juvenile years; a full house over the holidays; much Blue or Green in the color history
rarer: living alone; belonging below 0.35 (then it is loneliness, not this); much Red in the color history
times: Most parents of young children and most carers, a few times a year (estimate)
gap: 0-0.5
scene: Someone is talking in every room of the house. {N} stands in the kitchen holding a cup of tea gone cold, wanting one hour with nobody in it.
scene W: {N} has been there for everyone, every day, for weeks. {N} is ashamed to want time alone, and wants it badly.
scene U: {Ns} thoughts keep getting cut off halfway. {N} longs for a long, quiet stretch to finish just one of them.
scene B: Everyone takes a piece of {N}. {N} starts to think that some of {Ns} time ought to belong to {N}.
scene R: One more question, one more knock on the door, and {N} feels ready to scream.
scene G: Even wolves leave the pack for a while. {N} feels the pull of the quiet places, the way a thirsty animal feels water.
- W | ask the household for one protected hour a day, and keep it as agreed | v: security, conformity | chance: 72
- U | lock the door, switch off every screen, and follow one thought to its end | v: self-direction | chance: 85
- B | invent an appointment, and spend the time alone instead | habit | v: hedonism, self-direction | mark: hid a wrong | chance: 90
- R | slam the door, put the music on loud, and let nobody in | v: hedonism, self-direction | chance: 70
- G | slip off alone to the woods for the day, telling no one where | v: universalism (nature), self-direction | closed: approval: vanishing without a word; backfire: a search, and a row on return | chance: 85
- W>U | sign up for a meditation class, and keep its rule of silence | door | v: tradition, self-direction | chance: 80
- U>B | rework the week so one evening belongs to nobody but yourself | v: self-direction, hedonism | chance: 75
- B>R | spend your own money on a day out alone, doing exactly as you please | v: hedonism, self-direction | chance: 92
- R>G | take the bike and ride until the houses run out | door | body: light | v: stimulation, universalism (nature) | chance: 92
- G>W | rise before everyone else, and keep the dawn hour as a quiet rite | habit | v: tradition, security | chance: 78
works: {N} gets the quiet hour, and comes back to the others gentler.
works: Alone at last, {N} hears {Ns} own thoughts again, and likes some of them.
fails: The quiet never comes, and {N} snaps at the people {N} loves.
fails: {N} takes the time, and comes back to a house full of hurt feelings.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- pleasant and energising states

== pride after a success
tier: inner
stages: all
age: 12-110
tone: joy
life: work, school, leisure
horizon: week
roles: parent, mentor, colleague, friend
earth: you did the hard thing, and did it well, and the glow of it will not go away
requires: an option succeeded within the week that was hard for the person (difficulty above their skill) in a field they care about, or praise from someone they respect; competence rising
likelier: success credited to effort; childhood and juvenile years; much Black or White in the color history (standing matters)
rarer: much Green humility in the color history; a circle where self-praise is frowned on; the success came at someone else's cost
times: Nearly everyone, a few times a year after a hard thing done well (estimate)
gap: 0-0.5
scene: {N} did it. The hard thing, the one {N} was not sure of, is done and done well, and the glow keeps coming back all week.
scene W: {N} kept at it when it would have been easy to stop, and it was done properly. It was earned, fairly.
scene U: {N} keeps going back over how it was done, admiring the pieces that fitted, already seeing what could be better next time.
scene B: {N} won, and everyone saw. {N} intends to make sure they keep remembering it.
scene R: {N} wants to run down the street shouting. {N} did it, {N} actually did it.
scene G: {N} feels it like sun on the back after a long climb, warm and quiet and deserved.
- W | frame the certificate and hang it where the family can see | v: achievement, tradition | chance: 90
- U | take on a harder challenge straight away, while the skill is fresh | v: achievement, self-direction | mark: learned a skill | chance: 70
- B | let yourself look down a little on the ones who did not make it | v: power | chance: 74
- R | run home and tell everyone you meet on the way | v: stimulation, hedonism | chance: 80
- G | savour it quietly, and thank the people who helped along the way | v: benevolence, tradition (humility) | chance: 92
- W>B | claim the title, the badge or the rank it formally entitles you to | identity | v: power, achievement | act: claim the title, the badge or the rank it formally entitles them to | chance: 90
- U>R | use the same method on something twice as wild, just for the thrill | v: stimulation | chance: 55
- B>G | spend the reward on a pet or a garden plot of your own to tend | binds | v: security, universalism (nature) | chance: 88
- R>W | take the whole team out to celebrate, and toast every one of them | v: benevolence | tags: pay:money-.05 | chance: 90
- G>U | take someone younger under your wing, and pass the skill on properly | binds | v: benevolence, tradition | chance: 75
works: The glow carries {N} through the next hard thing too.
works: People remember it, and {N} is asked to do more.
fails: {N} makes too much of it, and people start to roll their eyes.
fails: The next try goes badly, and the glow turns into pressure.

== a curiosity that will not let go
tier: inner
stages: all
age: 12-110
tone: joy
life: school, leisure, nature
horizon: months
roles: mentor, friend, grandparent, a teacher
earth: a question lodges in your head, a strange object, a half-told story, a puzzle, and it will not let you go
requires: safety and competence at 0.45 or more (enough security to explore), time above 0.3, and within the week a gap noticed between what the person knows and wants to know (a puzzle, a strange object, a half-told story, a new field within reach)
likelier: childhood; a secure base (belonging above 0.6); much Blue in the color history; free time; a new place or person nearby; old age, for a chosen subject
rarer: stress above 1.5; money below 0.2; a rigid routine; exhaustion
times: Many people, a few times a year; for some it becomes a lifelong interest (estimate)
gap: 0-0.5
scene: It started with something small, a strange object, a word, a half-told story. Now {N} thinks about it on the bus, in the bath, falling asleep.
scene W: {N} wants to understand it properly, the right way, from the beginning, with nothing skipped.
scene U: There is a gap, and {N} can almost see the shape of what fills it. Not knowing has become an itch {N} cannot leave alone.
scene B: Whoever understands this first will have something nobody else has. {N} means to be that person.
scene R: {N} cannot sit still with it. {N} wants to go and see, touch and try, right now, and find out by doing.
scene G: {N} watches it the way one watches a bird: patiently, without grabbing, waiting for it to show what it is.
- W | ask a teacher or an expert, and follow the proper course of study | door | v: conformity, self-direction | chance: 82
- U | take it apart, look everything up, and keep notes until you understand | habit | v: self-direction | mark: learned a skill | chance: 90
- B | open the letter, drawer or file that was meant to stay shut | v: self-direction, power | mark: hid a wrong | closed: approval: snooping; backfire: caught, and trusted less | chance: 88
- R | go and see it for yourself, today, whatever it takes to get there | door | v: stimulation, self-direction | chance: 78
- G | watch it patiently over many days, and let it show what it is | v: universalism (nature), self-direction | chance: 69
- W>R | join the club or society for it, and go on every outing | v: stimulation, conformity | mark: made a friend | chance: 80
- U>G | learn the name of every bird, stone, star or bone in it | v: universalism (nature), self-direction | chance: 78
- B>W | offer what you have found out in exchange for a place in the club | binds | v: power, conformity | chance: 75
- R>U | try it with your own hands straight away, and learn from every mistake | v: self-direction, stimulation | chance: 80
- G>B | keep what you discovered to yourself, the way a fox keeps its den | v: security, power | chance: 72
works: The answer comes, and with it three new questions {N} cannot wait to chase.
works: {N} understands it at last, and the understanding feels like a small light switched on.
fails: The trail goes cold, and the question nags at {N} for months.
fails: Curiosity leads {N} somewhere {N} should not have gone.

== ambition wakes up
tier: inner
stages: juvenile+
age: 16-75
tone: joy
life: work, school
horizon: years
roles: boss, mentor, rival, colleague
earth: someone mentions an opening above you, and for the first time you think: why not me?
