scene U: {N} starts mapping the path: the skills needed, the years, the people who decide. It looks long, and possible.
scene B: {N} can see the next rung, and the one after that. For the first time, {N} wants the whole ladder.
scene R: {Ns} heart is up. {N} wants to go for it now, today, before the feeling has time to cool.
scene G: {N} feels something in {Ns} own nature stretching, like a sapling that has found the light.
