- U>W | find out in secret what the selection panel wants, then be exactly that | v: achievement, conformity | closed: approval: prying into the selection; backfire: found out, and struck off the list | chance: 60
- B>U | pay for a coach who has trained winners before | habit | v: achievement | mark: learned a skill | chance: 78
- R>B | pitch your boldest idea straight to the people at the top, today | v: achievement, stimulation | chance: 40
- G>R | return to the craft you were born for, and make your own name in it | identity | v: self-direction, achievement | mark: took a wild risk | chance: 55
works: The first step lands, and the ladder looks climbable.
works: {N} gets the chance, and rises to meet it.
fails: The door stays shut, and {N} has to swallow the wanting.
fails: {N} climbs, and finds the view from the next rung is not what {N} hoped.

== the urge to make something
tier: inner
stages: all
age: 12-110
tone: joy
