fails: {N} fumbles the thanks, and it comes out stiff and awkward.
fails: The gift turns into a debt {N} feels obliged to keep repaying.

== a quiet contentment
tier: inner
stages: young_adult+
age: 20-110
tone: joy
life: home, family
horizon: months
roles: partner, child, a neighbour
earth: an ordinary evening, the dishes done, someone you love in the next room, and the sudden thought: this is enough
requires: safety, belonging and competence all at 0.55 or more for twelve weeks or more, with no life event in that time, stress below 0.6 and satisfaction above 0.6
