scene: An ordinary evening. The dishes are done, someone {N} loves is humming in the next room, and {N} thinks, quite suddenly: this is enough.
scene W: Everything is in its place, the bills are paid, the people {N} is responsible for are safe. {N} feels the deep quiet of things done right.
scene U: {N} notices, almost with surprise, that there is nothing to fix tonight, and wonders how long that can last.
scene B: {N} built this, piece by piece. Looking round at it, {N} feels the satisfaction of someone who got what they came for.
scene R: {N} puts the music on low and dances a few steps round the kitchen, alone, for no reason at all.
scene G: The light goes gold across the garden. {N} sits on the step and feels part of it, rooted and unhurried.
- W | refuse every change at work or in the street, and complain about whoever pushes one | v: security, conformity | closed: approval: blocking every change; backfire: left behind, and resented for it | chance: 45
- U | write down what makes these days good, so it can be kept | v: security, self-direction | chance: 92
- B | put money aside every month, so this life stays safe whatever comes | habit | v: security, power (resources) | chance: 90
- R | throw the doors open and invite everyone round for a long, loud lunch | v: hedonism, benevolence | chance: 90
- G | turn down the move or the promotion, and stay where you are rooted | identity | v: security, tradition | mark: stayed home | chance: 90
- W>G | join the parish or village council, to keep the place as it is | binds | v: tradition, security | tags: commit:community | chance: 78
- U>W | draw up the household budget and the will, so everything stays in order | v: security, conformity | chance: 93
- B>U | buy the books, telescope or course you always wanted, now there is room | door | v: self-direction, hedonism | chance: 92
- R>B | spend a little on yourself, without guilt, because you have earned it | v: hedonism | tags: pay:money-.05 | chance: 93
- G>R | walk barefoot on the grass at dusk, and let the evening last | body: light | v: hedonism, universalism (nature) | chance: 95
works: The evening goes on being good, and {N} lets it.
works: {N} notices the good days for what they are, and keeps them.
fails: A small restlessness creeps in, and the contentment starts to feel like a rut.
fails: {N} holds on so tightly to how things are that the first change feels like a disaster.

== hope after a hard time
tier: inner
stages: all
age: 12-110
tone: joy
life: work, body, family
horizon: months
roles: friend, partner, mentor, parent
earth: after a long, hard stretch, a door opens a crack, and you catch yourself making plans again
requires: a hard stretch within the last year (stress above 1.5, or a loss, an illness, a job lost or a breakup), now easing: stress falling for six weeks or more, and within the month a way opening (an offer, a recovery, a reconciliation, a treatment working, someone who believes in the person)
likelier: outlook above 0.45; earlier successes; support (ties above 0.5); a faith commitment held
rarer: repeated failures within the year (outlook below 0.3); money below 0.15 for a long time; baseline mood below 0.4
times: Most people, every few years as a hard stretch eases (estimate)
gap: 2-5
scene: After the long hard months, a door has opened, only a crack. {N} catches themselves making plans again, and is almost afraid to.
scene W: {N} kept going through the worst of it, one day and one duty at a time. Now, it seems, the keeping going is being answered.
scene U: {N} can see a way through now, step by step, and wants to write the steps down before the picture blurs.
scene B: The bad stretch taught {N} what {N} can survive. Now {N} wants to see what {N} can take.
scene R: {Ns} chest feels light for the first time in months. {N} wants to tell everyone, to sing, to run.
scene G: The first shoots after a long winter. {N} does not trust them yet, but cannot stop looking.
- W | keep every promise you made in the dark days, one by one | v: conformity, tradition | mark: kept your word | chance: 75
- U | make a careful step-by-step plan, and start on step one this week | v: self-direction, security | chance: 85
- B | apply for everything going, and grab whatever comes first | v: achievement | chance: 81
- R | sign up on the spot for the race, course or trip you promised yourself | binds | v: stimulation, achievement | chance: 80
- G | let it come slowly, and do not rush the healing | v: security, tradition (humility) | chance: 72
- W>U | follow the recovery plan or the course to the end, step by step | v: security, self-direction | mark: learned a skill | chance: 67
- U>B | write up how you got through, and put it where people will notice | identity | v: achievement, power (face) | chance: 62
- B>R | treat yourself to the big thing you went without all through the hard months | v: hedonism, stimulation | chance: 90
- R>G | celebrate, loud and long, with the people who stood by through it all | v: benevolence, tradition | chance: 90
- G>W | plant a tree with the family, to tend together in the years to come | binds | v: tradition, benevolence | tags: pay:money-.05 | chance: 85
works: The door opens wider, and {N} walks through it.
works: The plans hold, one small step after another, and the hard time slips into the past.
fails: The hope comes too early, and the next setback hits harder for it.
fails: The opening closes again, and {N} has to wait for another.

== inspiration strikes
tier: inner
stages: all
age: 12-110
tone: joy
life: leisure, work, making
horizon: week
roles: mentor, friend, colleague
earth: you watched someone do something so well it lit something in you, and you cannot sit still
requires: within the week the person saw someone do something excellent (a performance, a speech, a feat, a well-made thing) or met an idea that opens a possibility; time above 0.25 and stress below 1.5
likelier: much Blue or Red in the color history; mastery goals; a free evening; a mentor
rarer: fatigue; a rigid routine; outlook below 0.3 (cynicism)
times: Many people, a few times a year: a concert, a match, a talk, a well-made thing (estimate)
gap: 0-0.5
scene: {N} watched someone do something so well that the whole room went quiet. On the way home {Ns} head is buzzing, and {N} cannot sit still.
scene W: That is what it looks like when something is done truly right. {N} wants to be worthy of it.
scene U: {N} is already taking it apart in {Ns} head: how it was done, what made it work, what {N} could do with the same idea.
scene B: {N} saw what that kind of skill earns: the silence, the applause, the name. {N} wants that.
scene R: Something caught fire in {N} tonight. {N} wants to start now, this minute, before the fire goes out.
scene G: {N} recognised something in it, the way one recognises a song from childhood: this is what {N} was made for.
- W | write to thank them properly, and ask how they learned it | v: benevolence, self-direction | mark: made a friend | chance: 72
- U | study their work line by line, and pass off a copy as your own | v: achievement | mark: hid a wrong | closed: approval: copying another's work; backfire: exposed, and the name ruined | chance: 70
- B | ask to work for them, and make yourself indispensable | v: achievement, power | chance: 59
- R | drop what you are doing, and throw everything at the new idea from tomorrow | v: self-direction, stimulation | chance: 62
- G | trust the pull, and give it a season to take root | v: self-direction | chance: 62
- W>B | enrol in the academy's formal programme, and aim for its top prize | v: achievement | chance: 45
- U>R | start drafting that same night, and keep going until dawn | v: self-direction, stimulation | chance: 80
- B>G | turn the idea into something to sell from home, with the family helping | v: achievement, security | chance: 68
- R>W | tell everyone what you saw, and talk them into joining in | v: benevolence, universalism | chance: 65
- G>U | go out into the woods or fields, and let the idea grow in silence | door | v: self-direction | chance: 68
works: {N} makes a start that same week, and the start holds.
works: The spark turns into something real, rough at first, then better.
fails: By the weekend the fire has gone out, and {N} feels foolish.
fails: {N} throws too much at the new idea too fast, and it collapses.

== awe
tier: inner
stages: all
age: 12-110
tone: joy
life: nature, faith, leisure
horizon: moment
roles: friend, child, grandparent
earth: a sky full of stars, the sea, a mountain, a birth, and suddenly your own worries look very small
requires: within the day something vast (mountains, the sea, a night sky away from city light, a storm, a cathedral, a birth, a great work of art, a crowd moving as one), with stress below 1.5
likelier: time outdoors and travel; a faith commitment held; childhood and old age; much Green or Blue in the color history
rarer: a city life that rarely leaves town; hurry (time below 0.15); long hours in front of screens
times: Most people, a few times a year at this strength: a night sky, the sea, a mountain, a birth (estimate)
gap: 0-0.5
scene: {N} stands under a sky so full of stars that the dark between them looks crowded. {Ns} worries shrink to their true size.
scene W: Something this vast must have an order to it. {N} feels the urge to kneel, or to give thanks to someone.
scene U: {N} tries to take it in and cannot. How far away is that light? How old? {N} needs to know.
scene B: Standing before it, {N} feels very small, and then, strangely, very hungry: to matter, to leave a mark this size.
scene R: {Ns} skin prickles from head to foot. {N} wants to shout into it, or laugh, or cry, all at once.
scene G: {N} feels like one leaf on a very old tree, and the feeling is not frightening at all. It is like coming home.
- W | shush the loud ones nearby, so the moment is kept as it should be | v: tradition, conformity | closed: approval: telling strangers off; backfire: a row on the spot | chance: 56
- U | sign up for a year's evening course in the stars, the rocks or the sea | binds | v: self-direction, universalism (nature) | mark: learned a skill | tags: pay:money-.05 | chance: 82
- B | climb the highest peak within reach, so you stand above all of it | body: heavy | v: achievement, power | mark: took a wild risk | chance: 78
- R | strip off and run into the sea, or shout from the summit | body: light | v: stimulation, hedonism | chance: 90
- G | sit still until the feeling settles into your bones | v: universalism (wisdom), tradition (humility) | chance: 90
- W>R | join a group walk along the old pilgrim road, singing with strangers | door | v: tradition, stimulation | chance: 85
- U>G | map and photograph the place, and campaign to have it protected | identity | v: universalism (nature) | chance: 55
- B>W | talk whoever has the power into protecting the place for good | v: universalism, power | chance: 30
- R>U | go back night after night, chasing the feeling, until you understand it | habit | v: stimulation, self-direction | chance: 65
- G>B | climb the fence into the reserve at night, to have it all to yourself | v: hedonism, universalism (nature) | mark: defied an authority | closed: law: trespass; backfire: caught by the warden, and fined | chance: 78
works: The feeling stays with {N} for days, and {N} is kinder to everyone for it.
works: {N} comes home changed, with the vastness folded quietly inside.
fails: The moment passes, and {N} cannot find the feeling again.
fails: Chasing it, {N} takes a risk too far, and the day ends badly.

== an old song brings it all back
tier: inner
stages: juvenile+
age: 25-110
tone: joy
life: home, family, friends
horizon: week
roles: grandparent, friend, sibling, an old flame
earth: an old song comes on the radio, and you are seventeen again, with the window down and the whole summer ahead
requires: a smell, song, place or object from the past within the day, or a reunion, a move or a round birthday; plus belonging or meaning below 0.55 (the present feels thin), or age above 50
likelier: belonging below 0.4; boredom or meaninglessness within the year; moving house; old age; much Green or White in the color history
rarer: a full, absorbing present (satisfaction above 0.75); much Red in the color history (living for now)
times: Nearly everyone, a few times a year at this strength; about 4 in 5 students felt nostalgia at least weekly (Wildschut and colleagues 2006)
gap: 0-0.5
scene: An old song comes on in the shop, and for three minutes {N} is seventeen again, with the window down and the whole summer ahead.
scene W: Things were done properly then: Sunday dinners, letters answered, everyone in their place. {N} misses the shape of it.
scene U: {N} tries to remember exactly how it was, and notices the memory is warmer than the facts. {N} wonders which to trust.
scene B: {N} remembers who {N} was back then, hungry and sure of everything, and wants a little of that edge back.
scene R: The song goes straight to {Ns} chest. {N} turns it up loud and sings every word.
scene G: The smell of cut grass and woodsmoke, and {N} is back in {grandparent}'s garden, small and safe, with the long evening ahead.
- W | insist the family keep every old custom, and shame anyone who skips one | v: tradition, conformity | closed: approval: shaming relatives; backfire: a rift at the next holiday | chance: 50
- U | put the family's old pictures and letters in order, with dates and names | v: tradition, self-direction | chance: 90
- B | look up the old flame or the old friend, just to see what might have been | v: hedonism, self-direction | chance: 75
- R | put the old records on loud, and sing every word with the windows open | v: hedonism, stimulation | chance: 93
- G | move back to the town where you grew up | binds | identity | v: tradition, security | mark: came home | tags: pay:money-.1 | chance: 68
- W>G | organise a reunion of the old class, team or street | v: benevolence, tradition | mark: made a friend | chance: 85
- U>W | take on the job of keeping the town's archive | binds | v: tradition, conformity | chance: 70
- B>U | buy back the old house, car or toys, and restore them piece by piece | identity | v: hedonism, achievement | chance: 70
- R>B | get the old band back together, and play to win | binds | v: stimulation, achievement | chance: 62
- G>R | climb the hill where you played as a child, and stay to watch the sunset | v: tradition, hedonism | chance: 92
works: {N} comes back from the past warmed, and the present feels less thin.
works: An old thread, picked up again, turns out to still be strong.
fails: The past looks so golden that the present seems grey beside it.
fails: {N} goes looking for the old days and finds them gone.
